{"step_index":133,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T09:17:18Z","thinking":"We need to create missing run_pipeline.py file. Also need to copy entire app folder. We've already created many files; need to create other modules: app/bus/bus.py, app/grpc_server/server.py, app/os_actuator/actuator.py, maybe app/vision/... we already have hand.py.\n\nAlso need run_pipeline.py. Let's create those.\n\nAlso need __init__ for bus, grpc_server, bus etc. We'll create.\n\nAfter creating, copy to C:\\hackbattle again, ensuring run_pipeline exists.\n\nLet's write files.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Bus module\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import zmq\\nimport structlog\\n\\nlog = structlog.get_logger(__name__)\\n\\nclass Bus:\\n    def __init__(self, ctx=None):\\n        self.ctx = ctx or zmq.Context()\\n        self.pub = self.ctx.socket(zmq.PUB)\\n        self.sub = self.ctx.socket(zmq.SUB)\\n\\n    # ---------- publishing ----------\\n    def bind_pub(self, address: str):\\n        self.pub.bind(address)\\n\\n    def publish(self, topic: str, protobuf_msg):\\n        self.pub.send_multipart([topic.encode(), protobuf_msg.SerializeToString()])\\n\\n    # ---------- subscribing ----------\\n    def connect_sub(self, address: str, topics):\\n        self.sub.connect(address)\\n        for t in topics:\\n            self.sub.setsockopt(zmq.SUBSCRIBE, t.encode())\\n\\n    def recv(self):\\n        topic, payload = self.sub.recv_multipart()\\n        return topic.decode(), payload\\n\"","Description":"\"ZeroMQ bus wrapper used by all components\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\adars_6dx4mbx\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\6e28a4ed-fc85-4580-a070-51c45fab79ce\\\\app\\\\bus\\\\bus.py\"","toolAction":"\"Create bus module\"","toolSummary":"\"File creation\""}}]}
